Falsifies `clock_contract::verification::a_proposal_is_accepted_only_inside_the_policy_bounds`.

The defect: the forward step bound is off by one (`MAXIMUM_STEP_FORWARD_NANOSECONDS + 1`), so a
proposal one nanosecond past the largest allowed step is accepted.

Expected to fail: the harness's `assert!(proposed - current <= ...MAXIMUM_STEP_FORWARD_NANOSECONDS)`.

